<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/40/msa@/~cl_5__para_b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/40/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/40/msa@/~cl_5__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "dalam subseksyen (2), dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “anggota Suruhanjaya” perkataan “, selain anggota yang disebut dalam subseksyen (1),”. Pindaan seksyen 10"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/40/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/40/msa@/~cl_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/40/msa@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/40/msa@> .
